  the last element of the first row is ignored.

  >>> x = [[2., 3., 4., 5.], [-1., -2., -3., -4.]]
  >>> y = tf.zeros([4, 4])
  >>> z = tf.linalg.set_diag(y, x, align='LEFT_RIGHT', k=(0, 1))
  >>> z
